WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0123: WoW's own MSAA with the frame export (on top of 0001-0122).

0003 refused a multisampled world camera (copy_texture_to_buffer cannot copy a multisampled depth texture) and the
launcher forced WOW_MSAA=off. With the render plugin putting WoW's world in after BG3's TAA, WoW's edges are smoothed
by WoW's own multisampling instead. The colour already comes from the resolved main texture (Bevy resolves the
multisampled target into it at the end of the main passes); the depth is now resolved by a compute pass: per pixel
the nearest sample (reverse-Z: the largest), written in the readback's row layout and copied into the slot.

